\q1 because¦313121 Yahweh's¦313126 message¦313124 has become¦313123 a reproach¦313128 and derision¦313129 for me, all day¦313132 \add long\add*.
\q1
\v 9 If I say¦313134 that I won't \add ≈mention\add* him
\q1 and won't speak¦313140 in his name¦313142 anymore,
