\p
\v 11 As for Yehudah's¦313554 king¦313553, listen¦313555 to this message¦313556 from Yahweh¦313558
\v 12 for David's¦313561 descendants:
\q1 Administer¦313564 justice¦313567 \add every\add* morning¦313566
\q1 and rescue¦313568 anyone¦313569 who's been robbed¦313569, from their oppressor¦313571,
\q1 otherwise my fury will go¦313574 out like fire¦313575
