\v 3 Yahweh¦313657 says \add that you must\add* administer justice¦313659 and \add ≈do what's right¦313660\add*. Rescue anyone¦313662 who's been robbed¦313662, from their oppressor¦313664. Don't mistreat any foreigner or orphan or widow¦313667. Don't be violent¦313673, and don't¦313668 shed innocent¦313675 blood¦313674 in this place¦313679,
\v 4 because if you carefully¦313685 do those things¦313689, then the kings¦313695 who sit on David's¦313697 throne¦313700 will enter through the gates¦313692 of this palace riding in chariots¦313702 or on horses¦313703, \add ≈along with\add* their officials and their people¦313707.
