\v 1 This was the message¦319326 that¦319327 came to Yirmeyah from Yahweh¦319334 in the tenth¦319337 year of \add the reign of\add* Yehudah's¦319340 King¦319339 Tsidkiyah \add (Zedekiah¦319338\add*, the eighteenth¦319343 year of Nebuchadnezzar's¦319347 \add reign)\add*.\x + \xo 32:1: \xt 2Ki 25:1-7.\x*
