\v 4 Yahweh¦326618 says¦326617 to tell \add @Baruk\add*, Listen, I'm about to tear down what I've built¦326622 throughout the \add ≈world\add*, and to pull out what I've planted¦326628.
\v 5 \add ≈But¦326638 maybe\add* you're¦326639 hoping for great¦326642 things for yourself? Don't¦326643 hope for that, because¦326646 listen, disaster is coming for all humanity, but¦326638 wherever¦326668 you go¦326669, I'm giving you your life¦326662 as your ‘spoil of war’. That is Yahweh's¦326657 declaration.
\c 46
