\v 2 This is about the army of the Egyptian king Far-oh Nekoh \add (Pharaoh¦326691 Necho¦326692)\add* who was at Karkemish by the Perat \add (Euphrates¦326702)\add* river¦326700. That was the army that¦326695 the Babylonian King Nebuchadnezzar¦326706 defeated¦326705 in the fourth¦326710 year \add of the reign\add* of Yehudah's¦326716 King Yehoyakim \add (Jehoiakim)\add*, son of Yoshiyah \add (Josiah)\add*:\x + \xo 46:2-26: \xt Isa 19:1-25; Eze 29:1–32:32.\x*
