\q1 Ethiopia \add (Kush¦326802)\add* and Libya \add (Put¦326803)\add*,
\q1 men skillful with a shield¦326805,
\q1 ≈and Lydia¦326806, men skillful at \add ≈using\add* bows \add and arrows\add*.’
