\q1
\v 10 That day will be the day of vengeance¦326817 for the master, Commander-in-chief Yahweh, \add ≈when\add* he'll avenge¦326818 himself¦326818 on his enemies.
\q1 The sword¦326821 will devour¦326820 and¦326811 be satisfied¦326822—it'll drink its fill of their¦326824 blood¦326824
