\p
\v 13 ⇔When the Babylonian King¦326880 Nebuchadnezzar¦326879 was coming¦326878 to attack¦326882 Egypt¦326886, Yahweh¦326873 \add ≈gave\add* the prophet¦326877 Yirmeyah \add &this\add* message¦326870:\x + \xo 46:13: \xt Jer 43:10-13.\x*
