\v 14 Announce in Egypt¦326889, and proclaim it¦326901 in Migdol¦326891, Memphis¦326893, and Tahpanhes¦326894:
\q1 ‘Take your¦326896 station and prepare¦326897 \add to defend\add* yourself,
\q1 because¦326899 \add ≈everyone around¦326903 you¦326903 will be killed\add*.’
